        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Breashears, Richard Bass, Micah Hauptman\n- Concepts: Seven Summits\n- Roles: mountaineer, filmmaker, author, motivational speaker, businessman, rancher, actor\n- Works: In Stereo, Parker, Everest\n\nFacts:\n- David Finlay Breashears was born on December 20, 1955, and he is an American mountaineer, filmmaker, author, and motivational speaker.\n- Richard Daniel \"Dick\" Bass was born on December 21, 1929, and died on July 26, 2015, and he was an American businessman, rancher, and mountaineer.\n- Micah A. Hauptman is an American film and television actor known for playing David Gallo in the film \"In Stereo,\" August Hardwicke in the film \"Parker,\" and David Breashears in the film \"Everest.\"\n- The Seven Summits achievement is recognized as an exploration and mountaineering accomplishment.",
